======================================================================================
  IS THE DRIFT REAL, OR IS IT COMPOSITION?
======================================================================================

      K  occupied     drift  no drift    worth   mean|g|   max|g|   purity  mid/blk
     13        13    -7.441    -8.147   +0.706    2.5675     8.39    0.997      9.1
     24        24    -6.948    -7.246   +0.298    1.2853     8.29    0.998      5.0
     48        48    -6.864   -14.672   +7.808    1.4867     9.01    0.999      2.9
